  "historyNote": "#7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 600) ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10205, eff 10-19-12; ss by #12348, eff 8-14-17",
